clueweb09-en0002-67-12406.0 gsmd fails to recognize network registration [openmoko.com] Home Wiki Bugzilla Planet Projects Lists gsmd fails to recognize network registration Rod Whitby rod at whitby.id.au Sun Aug 26 14:54:31 CEST 2007 Previous message: [PATCH] fix V0 mode support for qualcomm chip (htc universal) Next message: gsmd fails to recognize network registration Messages sorted by: [ date ] [ thread ] [ subject ] [ author ] I've attached the full log from boot at the end of the message, but the interesting bit may be: Sun Aug 26 14:21:32 2007 <1> atcmd.c:545:atcmd_submit() submitting command `AT+CFUN=1' Sun Aug 26 14:21:37 2007 <1> atcmd.c:545:atcmd_submit() submitting command `AT+COPS=0' Sun Aug
